  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zDxHgP6.png\" alt=\"德瑞克坐在高品質零件王座上\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /></p>\n<p><br /><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YeQZceJ.png\" alt=\"時尚Discord橫幅按鈕\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24auqwO.png\" alt=\"時尚Patreon橫幅按鈕\" width=\"234\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-end-of-minecraft\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Om4BpzM.png\" alt=\"時尚TEOM橫幅按鈕\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br /><br /><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wO7SxtPEG7A?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe><br /><br /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hokDQXd.png\" alt=\"官方UNU模組包\" width=\"700\" height=\"52\" /><br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hXzPxBhhmY8\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bih0TeG.png\" alt=\"無關緊要的間隔圖\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LEbdi0V.png\" alt=\"UNU民用\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-military-pack-for-mts\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xcDyZDh.png\" alt=\"UNU軍事圖標\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-unuverse-pack\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSIuQFB.png\" alt=\"UNU宇宙圖標\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g6QdnguNEYU\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aKb9C5J.png\" alt=\"右側蓋板\" width=\"70\" height=\"140\" /></a><br /><br /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ntUooe7.png\" alt=\"合作夥伴模組包橫幅\" width=\"700\" height=\"52\" /><br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TBO9ANTBCjM\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xv1NSIN.png\" alt=\"左側蓋板\" width=\"70\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dkz-automotive-industries\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8yW6BWm.png\" alt=\"DKZ圖標\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iv-mts-unu-bjorns-customs\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jZ9oDLq.png\" alt=\"比約恩圖標\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randall-agriculture-pack\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5aoUbYG.png\" alt=\"沉浸式農業圖標\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/syndicate-motor-foundry\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nGhvvp8.png\" alt=\"辛迪加圖標\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ea6py9q46QU\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aKb9C5J.png\" alt=\"右側蓋板\" width=\"70\" height=\"140\" /></a><br /><br /></p>\n<p>UNU零件需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft運輸模擬器<br /><br /></a></p>\n<p>UNU零件為其他MTS模組包提供各種高品質零件！<br /><br /></p>\n<p>從引擎、輪胎、座椅到公車廣告、貨櫃和履帶！UNU零件包擁有您所需的所有優質MTS零件™️！如果您的MTS模組包需要我們沒有的零件，我們會添加！我們為能為一些最優秀、最大的MTS模組包提供零件而感到自豪！<br /><br />UNU與官方UNU模組包搭配使用效果最佳：<br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\">UNU民用模組包</a> - 充滿必備的高品質載具！<br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-military-pack-for-mts\">UNU軍事模組包</a> - 保衛黑荊棘帝國！<br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-unuverse-pack\">擴展UNU宇宙模組包</a> - 更多獨特載具，豐富了龐大的UNU宇宙！<br /><br />試試這些優秀的UNU認可內容包！<br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dkz-automotive-industries\">DKZ工業汽車部門</a> -&nbsp;一系列出色的復古和經典載具！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iv-mts-unu-bjorns-customs\">比約恩的改裝</a> -&nbsp;比約恩的改裝是UNU民用和UNU零件的擴展。它包括承包商和承包商XL的改裝零件。<br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randall-agriculture-pack\">IV農業</a> - 一堆必備的農業配件！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/syndicate-motor-foundry\">辛迪加發動機鑄造廠</a> -&nbsp;一個為沉浸式載具提供新品牌載具和零件的內容包！<br /><br /><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\">加入我們的Discord！<br /><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\">在Patreon上支持UNU！<br /><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fallout-mc\">加入官方伺服器！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/drprofluigi\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f49d125b-80a8-4522-a819-1922543fb769.png\" alt=\"毫不掩飾的Bisecthosting贊助\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\" /></a></p>",
